eautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Na Smash Balloon, desenvolvemos softwares que ajudam voc\u00ea a criar feeds de m\u00eddia social responsivos para o seu site em minutos."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["Nossa miss\u00e3o \u00e9 simplificar ao m\u00e1ximo a inclus\u00e3o de feeds de m\u00eddia social no WordPress. Diga adeus a etapas de configura\u00e7\u00e3o complicadas, widgets de iframe sem gra\u00e7a ou taxas negativas de velocidade de p\u00e1gina."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Nossos plugins n\u00e3o s\u00e3o apenas f\u00e1ceis de usar, mas tamb\u00e9m totalmente personaliz\u00e1veis, confi\u00e1veis \u200b\u200be r\u00e1pidos! \u00c9 por isso que mais de 1,6 milh\u00e3o de usu\u00e1rios incr\u00edveis, assim como voc\u00ea, escolheram us\u00e1-los em seus sites."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Nossos outros plugins de feed de m\u00eddia social"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["N\u00e3o somos apenas um plugin de avalia\u00e7\u00f5es! Confira nossos outros plugins e adicione mais conte\u00fado ao seu site."],"Install":["Instalar"],"Installed":["Instalado"],"Social Wall":["Social Wall"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Combine feeds de todos os nossos plugins em um \u00fanico mural"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugins recomendados"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Dispensar"],"Search Documentation":["Pesquisar documenta\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Precisa de mais suporte? Estamos aqui para ajudar."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Enviar uma solicita\u00e7\u00e3o de suporte"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Obtenha ajuda no f\u00f3rum WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Nossa equipe de suporte r\u00e1pida e amig\u00e1vel est\u00e1 sempre feliz em ajudar!"],"System Info":["Informa\u00e7\u00f5es do sistema"],"Collapse":["Recolher"],"Expand":["Expandir"],"Export Settings":["Exportar configura\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Compartilhe facilmente as configura\u00e7\u00f5es do seu plugin com o suporte"],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Link"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Moderar feeds de avalia\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Display images and videos":["Exibir imagens e v\u00eddeos"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["\u00cdcone modal de upsell"],"And get much more!":["E ainda tem v\u00e1rias outras vantagens!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your website, reviews page or product page":[""],"Okay, got it":[""],"Refresh List":[""],"No reviews found!":[""],"Add the review by manually typing it out":[""],"Or Add from existing source":[""],"Add the review from an existing source you have already connected":[""],"Select Reviewer Avatar Image":[""],"Use this media":[""],"Add Image to Review":[""],"You are about to edit this review":[""],"This review is displayed in":[""],"feeds. Editing it will change it on both those places. This action is irreversible.":[""],"User Avatar":[""],"Add Reviewer Image":[""],"Remove reviewer image":[""],"Rate %d star":[""],"Rate %d stars":[""],"First Name":[""],"John":[""],"Dow":[""],"The review title goes here":[""],"The content title goes here":[""],"Link to the review (Optional)":[""],"Posted on":[""],"Remove image":[""],"There are no reviews in this source, please select